## Chord 4.0.2 lexer-golden corpus — the `claims` block (ADR-367), written
## over the rooms and things of `chord-4-surface.story`. A claims block lives
## in a fragment of its own and is never part of the story, so this file is
## a `.chord` fragment and not a story. Every spelling is lifted from the
## sharpee.net claims guide. Edit only alongside the golden file.

claims
  needs rooms: the Hall, the Cellar
  needs things: the iron key, the cellar door
  needs verbs: take, unlock, open

  claim the key is in hand
    the player has the iron key

  never the iron key leaves the Hall
    the iron key is not in the Hall
    needs rooms: the Hall
    needs things: the iron key
    needs verbs: take
end claims
